{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FPS: Multiplayer Demo is an online shooter game with 7 different game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Conquest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Search and Destroy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Kill Confirmed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Rush</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Team Deathmatch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Free 4 All</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Capture the Flag</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The following features are not included in the demo: Steam Achievements, Steam Cloud, Steam Leaderboards/Stats, in-game purchases, HDR. The demo includes a map and 3 demo characters. The features described above, as well as other game updates, will only appear in the main game. Requests and suggestions for improvement are always welcome!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863250?t=1752170632","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863250?t=1752170632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863250/2eece2378e77243c19c38115297ba0892353d94a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752170632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863250/2eece2378e77243c19c38115297ba0892353d94a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752170632","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id